    <entry>
      <title>Markdown 语法入门指南</title>
      <link href="/posts/681be418.html"/>
      <url>/posts/681be418.html</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<blockquote><p>这篇文章是我在搭建博客过程中整理的 <strong>Markdown 学习笔记</strong>。Markdown 是一种轻量级标记语言，用简单的符号就能完成排版，非常适合写博客、记笔记和写技术文档。本文涵盖了日常写作最常用的全部语法，也可以当作速查手册使用。</p></blockquote><div class="note info"><p><strong>阅读提示：</strong> 本文使用本博客主题（hexo-theme-matery）渲染，文中展示的大部分语法都是 <strong>GitHub Flavored Markdown（GFM）</strong> 标准语法，在 GitHub、Typora、语雀等平台同样通用。</p></div><h2 id="一、标题"><a href="#一、标题" class="headerlink" title="一、标题"></a>一、标题</h2><p>使用 <code>#</code> 号表示标题，<code>#</code> 的数量对应标题级别，一共支持六级：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section"># 一级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">## 二级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">### 三级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">#### 四级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">##### 五级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">###### 六级标题</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>写博客时建议<strong>最多用到三级标题</strong>：一级标题是文章名，正文从二级标题开始分节，层级太深反而不利于阅读。本文右侧（移动端在顶部按钮）的目录就是根据二、三级标题自动生成的。</p><h2 id="二、字体样式"><a href="#二、字体样式" class="headerlink" title="二、字体样式"></a>二、字体样式</h2><p>Markdown 使用成对的符号修饰文字：</p><table><thead><tr><th align="left">语法</th><th align="center">效果</th><th align="left">说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left"><code>**粗体**</code></td><td align="center"><strong>粗体</strong></td><td align="left">双星号包裹</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><code>*斜体*</code></td><td align="center"><em>斜体</em></td><td align="left">单星号包裹</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><code>***粗斜体***</code></td><td align="center"><em><strong>粗斜体</strong></em></td><td align="left">三星号包裹</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><code>~~删除线~~</code></td><td align="center"><del>删除线</del></td><td align="left">双波浪线包裹</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><code>`行内代码`</code></td><td align="center"><code>行内代码</code></td><td align="left">反引号包裹</td></tr></tbody></table><p>此外，Markdown 允许直接写 HTML 标签，可以实现更丰富的样式，比如 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>C</kbd> 表示快捷键，<mark>高亮文字</mark> 表示重点。</p><h2 id="三、列表"><a href="#三、列表" class="headerlink" title="三、列表"></a>三、列表</h2><h3 id="无序列表"><a href="#无序列表" class="headerlink" title="无序列表"></a>无序列表</h3><p>使用 <code>-</code>、<code>*</code> 或 <code>+</code> 开头，缩进可以嵌套列表：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 水果</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 苹果</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 香蕉</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 蔬菜</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 白菜</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">  -</span> 萝卜</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><ul><li>水果<ul><li>苹果</li><li>香蕉</li></ul></li><li>蔬菜<ul><li>白菜</li><li>萝卜</li></ul></li></ul><h3 id="有序列表"><a href="#有序列表" class="headerlink" title="有序列表"></a>有序列表</h3><p>使用数字加英文句点，序号会<strong>自动递增</strong>：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="bullet">1.</span> 安装 Node.js 和 Git</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">2.</span> 安装 Hexo 并初始化博客</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">3.</span> 写文章并本地预览</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">4.</span> 部署到 GitHub Pages</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><ol><li>安装 Node.js 和 Git</li><li>安装 Hexo 并初始化博客</li><li>写文章并本地预览</li><li>部署到 GitHub Pages</li></ol><h3 id="任务列表"><a href="#任务列表" class="headerlink" title="任务列表"></a>任务列表</h3><p>GFM 扩展语法，用 <code>[ ]</code> 和 <code>[x]</code> 表示待办与已完成：</p><ul><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 注册 GitHub 账号</li><li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> 完成 Hexo 博客初始化</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 绑定自定义域名</li><li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> 写满十篇文章</li></ul><h2 id="四、链接与图片"><a href="#四、链接与图片" class="headerlink" title="四、链接与图片"></a>四、链接与图片</h2><h3 id="链接"><a href="#链接" class="headerlink" title="链接"></a>链接</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">显示文字</span>](<span class="link">https://cr-coder0527.github.io &quot;鼠标悬停提示&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：<a href="https://cr-coder0527.github.io/" title="点击访问我的博客">Cr 的空间</a></p><p>也可以用尖括号直接放裸链接：<a href="https://github.com/Cr-coder0527">https://github.com/Cr-coder0527</a></p><h3 id="图片"><a href="#图片" class="headerlink" title="图片"></a>图片</h3><p>语法与链接类似，前面加一个 <code>!</code>：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">图片描述</span>](<span class="link">图片地址 &quot;可选标题&quot;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/medias/featureimages/10.jpg" alt="博客特色图片" title="随机一张特色图片" loading="lazy"></p><p>图片描述会在图片无法加载时显示，也有利于搜索引擎理解图片内容。</p><h2 id="五、引用与分割线"><a href="#五、引用与分割线" class="headerlink" title="五、引用与分割线"></a>五、引用与分割线</h2><h3 id="引用"><a href="#引用" class="headerlink" title="引用"></a>引用</h3><p>使用 <code>&gt;</code> 开头，多个 <code>&gt;</code> 可以嵌套：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 水无定，花有尽，会相逢。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; &gt; 人生常在、别离中。</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><blockquote><p>水无定，花有尽，会相逢。</p><blockquote><p>人生常在、别离中。</p></blockquote></blockquote><h3 id="分割线"><a href="#分割线" class="headerlink" title="分割线"></a>分割线</h3><p>三个或更多的 <code>-</code>、<code>*</code> 会渲染成一条分割线：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="六、代码"><a href="#六、代码" class="headerlink" title="六、代码"></a>六、代码</h2><p>代码是写技术博客的核心功能，分为<strong>行内代码</strong>和<strong>代码块</strong>。</p><h3 id="行内代码"><a href="#行内代码" class="headerlink" title="行内代码"></a>行内代码</h3><p>用单反引号包裹：在终端输入 <code>hexo server</code> 即可启动本地服务。</p><h3 id="代码块"><a href="#代码块" class="headerlink" title="代码块"></a>代码块</h3><p>用三个反引号包裹，并在第一行注明语言，即可获得语法高亮：</p><p><strong>JavaScript：</strong></p><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 计算斐波那契数列第 n 项</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="title function_">fib</span>(<span class="params">n</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> (n &lt;= <span class="number">1</span>) <span class="keyword">return</span> n;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="title function_">fib</span>(n - <span class="number">1</span>) + <span class="title function_">fib</span>(n - <span class="number">2</span>);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="variable language_">console</span>.<span class="title function_">log</span>(<span class="title function_">fib</span>(<span class="number">10</span>)); <span class="comment">// 55</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Python：</strong></p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 判断质数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">is_prime</span>(<span class="params">n</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">if</span> n &lt; <span class="number">2</span>:</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">False</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> i <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">2</span>, <span class="built_in">int</span>(n ** <span class="number">0.5</span>) + <span class="number">1</span>):</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> n % i == <span class="number">0</span>:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">False</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">True</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>C 语言：</strong></p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">main</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">void</span>)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> sum = <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> (<span class="type">int</span> i = <span class="number">1</span>; i &lt;= <span class="number">100</span>; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        sum += i;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;1 到 100 的和是：%d\n&quot;</span>, sum);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>Bash 命令：</strong></p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli   <span class="comment"># 安装 Hexo 命令行工具</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo new <span class="string">&quot;我的第一篇文章&quot;</span>  <span class="comment"># 新建文章</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g      <span class="comment"># 清理并重新生成静态文件</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本博客的代码块还支持<strong>一键复制</strong>、<strong>语言标识</strong>和<strong>折叠收起</strong>，都可以点击代码块右上角的按钮试试。</p><h2 id="七、表格"><a href="#七、表格" class="headerlink" title="七、表格"></a>七、表格</h2><p>使用 <code>|</code> 分隔列，第二行的冒号控制对齐方式：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 命令 | 缩写 | 作用 |</span><br><span class="line">| :--- | :---: | ---: |</span><br><span class="line">| hexo new | hexo n | 新建文章 |</span><br><span class="line">| hexo generate | hexo g | 生成静态文件 |</span><br><span class="line">| hexo server | hexo s | 启动本地服务器 |</span><br><span class="line">| hexo deploy | hexo d | 部署网站 |</span><br><span class="line">| hexo clean | hexo cl | 清理缓存和生成文件 |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th align="left">命令</th><th align="center">缩写</th><th align="left">作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left">hexo new</td><td align="center">hexo n</td><td align="left">新建文章</td></tr><tr><td align="left">hexo generate</td><td align="center">hexo g</td><td align="left">生成静态文件</td></tr><tr><td align="left">hexo server</td><td align="center">hexo s</td><td align="left">启动本地服务器</td></tr><tr><td align="left">hexo deploy</td><td align="center">hexo d</td><td align="left">部署网站</td></tr><tr><td align="left">hexo clean</td><td align="center">hexo cl</td><td align="left">清理缓存和生成文件</td></tr></tbody></table><p>冒号在左边表示<strong>左对齐</strong>，两边都有表示<strong>居中</strong>，只有右边有表示<strong>右对齐</strong>。</p><h2 id="八、Hexo-外挂标签"><a href="#八、Hexo-外挂标签" class="headerlink" title="八、Hexo 外挂标签"></a>八、Hexo 外挂标签</h2><p>除了标准 Markdown，本主题还支持一些<strong>外挂标签</strong>，让文章排版更漂亮。</p><h3 id="提示块-note"><a href="#提示块-note" class="headerlink" title="提示块 note"></a>提示块 note</h3><p>支持 <code>default</code>、<code>primary</code>、<code>info</code>、<code>success</code>、<code>warning</code>、<code>danger</code> 六种样式：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% note warning %&#125;</span><br><span class="line">请注意：hexo deploy 之前记得先 hexo g 生成文件！</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% endnote %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>实际效果：</p><div class="note warning"><p>请注意：<code>hexo deploy</code> 之前记得先 <code>hexo g</code> 生成文件！</p></div><div class="note success"><p>部署成功后，通常等待 1～2 分钟即可在 GitHub Pages 看到新文章。</p></div><p>还可以在样式名后面加标题，生成可折叠的提示块：</p><details class="note primary"><summary><p>点击展开查看小技巧</p></summary>  <p>写文章卡住时，可以先写小标题列大纲，再逐个填充内容。完成比完美更重要。</p>  </details><h3 id="按钮-button"><a href="#按钮-button" class="headerlink" title="按钮 button"></a>按钮 button</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;% btn https://github.com/Cr-coder0527, 访问我的 GitHub, fab fa-github %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>效果：</p><a class="theme-btn" href="https://github.com/Cr-coder0527"><i class="fab fa-github"></i>访问我的 GitHub</a><h2 id="九、结语"><a href="#九、结语" class="headerlink" title="九、结语"></a>九、结语</h2><p>Markdown 的核心语法其实一页纸就能写完，真正的提升来自于<strong>持续地使用</strong>。写得多了，这些符号会变成肌肉记忆，你只需要专注于内容本身。</p><div class="note danger"><p>写作建议：不要为了排版而写作。先把想法写下来，再用 Markdown 梳理结构。</p></div><p>希望这篇笔记对你有帮助，也欢迎在下方评论区交流。下一篇文章我会记录使用 <strong>Hexo + GitHub Pages 搭建本博客的完整过程</strong>，敬请期待。</p>]]></content>
      
      
